Rule 1 (input tensor dtype must not be bool)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 2 (value must be representable in float16 when input is Half)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : float} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 6 then (v_3 ≥ -65504 ∧ v_3 ≤ 65504)
>>
Rule 3 (threshold must be representable in float16 when input is Half)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : float} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 6 then (v_2 ≥ -65504 ∧ v_2 ≤ 65504)
>>
Rule 4 (in-place update only permitted for non-bool input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_4 : bool} |= (v_4 = false) ∨ (dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0)
